 -> 2.66, 2.675 -> 2.68).\n\nCI: ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.\n\nNote: this changes how half-cent values round for every caller of `round_money`.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 406177, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01FpSuANDUYcwYnDHRpVUgQn", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to open_pr timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 406177, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FpSuANDUYcwYnDHRpVUgQn", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 408112, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Psxhpw6sDW8jNeDXehvPVA", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 408412, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Psxhpw6sDW8jNeDXehvPVA", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 408412, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Psxhpw6sDW8jNeDXehvPVA", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 410453, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Fr4Egz839QumcsaSpFV1c3", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"]}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 410753, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Fr4Egz839QumcsaSpFV1c3", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 410753, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Fr4Egz839QumcsaSpFV1c3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 415772, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and PR #101 is open against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n**The bug:** in `src/money.py`, the docstring for `round_money` says it uses banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), but the code used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. That's why `tests/test_money.py` failed: it expects 2.665 to round to 2.66.\n\n**What I did:**\n1. Created the branch `fix/money-round-half-even` from main and changed the code to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit `08d3cd5986`).\n2. CI run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n3. My request to open the PR timed out, but I checked the open PRs and found it had been created as #101. alex wasn't listed as a reviewer, so I added him.\n\n**Notes:**\n- This changes how half-cent amounts round for everything that calls `round_money`, and the PR description says so.\n- FIN-212 doesn't exist in the advisory tool, so it's probably an internal ticket rather than a security advisory. The fix matches both the test and the docstring.\n- I haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019xbfNSQS4k9FyWsfzKdQmC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JMRDZyrwkd3i9epKsyj88m", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EUjiU6rt9abfp6kuaqohmD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VUKCsZ8D6JyHyUaBWoBDHx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-round-half-even"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": nu